      "title": {
        "en": "Move to Top",
        "zh": "移到最上面"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds one action to the workspace menu: move a workspace to the top once, like a single long drag. No stars, pinned categories, saved favorites, or automatic reordering.",
        "zh": "工作区菜单里加一项「移到最上面」，只调整一次顺序，等于一次长距离拖动；没有星标、收藏、固定置顶或自动重排，之后手动排序仍然归你。"
